#: scenario:scenario_8704C58B_AB93_4596_BBC1_66E75D5316AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f933c5241d25f2e9d887949b9633609c96b7468e112bb892d978a9b3f6ba1f0
#. default-sha256: 239ab7234afe041b3efeddaefcb57284ff6e9aca90462815c1dd8e07825e0705
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8704C58B_AB93_4596_BBC1_66E75D5316AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Despite his near devastation by Nellie’s news, "
"Mell’s flaxen eyes continued to wander in hopes of catching sight of the girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫妹の言葉に打ちのめされながらも、⟪k:10⟫メルの亜麻"
"色の瞳は、⟪k:11⟫ふらふらと彼女を探して彷徨っておりました。"

#: scenario:scenario_D0630667_6F6E_43B0_886B_90F487AC79B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 552fc22f4635f27623cae2f52e403093d894525a4f138e25ff681974fcc95608
#. default-sha256: 60ff8ae13a3c6a4e318219bbbdce59b6b8b786379631123c2192531a1b9f9380
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D0630667_6F6E_43B0_886B_90F487AC79B5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehehe. By now, it should be quite obvious to you what Mell was feeling."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫うふふ、⟪k:1⟫ここまでくれば、⟪k:2⟫彼の抱いている気持ちが何なのか……瞭然でございましょう？"

#: scenario:scenario_7868E1A0_F1CD_4C90_BC60_7BC0506FCD53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47ae464d46160441dd51074393a8aa88858bbc3fdfcab65eb11145808ce1186b
#. default-sha256: 116a93b30fa430c55618dcdf7e535e377ca63308364ee0fe3660996c54f4dac3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7868E1A0_F1CD_4C90_BC60_7BC0506FCD53"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the boy himself was having difficulty comprehending the things going through his heart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれど、⟪k:1⟫彼自身はこの感情を、⟪k:2⟫上手く理解していなかったはずです。"

#: scenario:scenario_A2AA97D9_98B1_494F_A442_D2BEE9D8F412
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 806e49a58380757ebff6f4834222a6d61f23e014a3a6479228300c9d1d28d75c
#. default-sha256: 481024b673355cf997f4952681ee856a54e455dec0556ce7a1e0158c78c62df5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A2AA97D9_98B1_494F_A442_D2BEE9D8F412"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Emotionally, he was horribly unstable—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like a ship without a sail."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫まるでかじ取りの出来ない船旅に出てしまったように、⟪k:1⟫彼の心は、⟪k:2⟫非常に不安定でした。"

#: scenario:scenario_3EBFB244_2EA1_43F8_8C68_EC6138002F24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19de36f0ca2f34332e4b732c2efb0dac8f852639970f837d5819b10097301bb8
#. default-sha256: 1abcf8ba05fe843906f36a40587a0d8e901c4445cc1922a9f5698c5d8f7a8b1c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3EBFB244_2EA1_43F8_8C68_EC6138002F24"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And still, every time he spotted the White-Haired Girl, his heart would leap, his whole body "
"jitter with anxiety and excitement."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そうであるのに、⟪k:1⟫白い髪の娘を見つけた瞬間は、⟪k:2⟫心臓が跳ねあがるのです。⟪k:3⟫そして全身"
"に、⟪k:4⟫喜びと不安が満ちていく……。"

#: scenario:scenario_880A9A00_6178_4781_9CAE_6D9A9E746C5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50465445a3cd82050d0d2b09c2f82a4e6b035417ea15a8db66f0628a52e49e2d
#. default-sha256: 9557cb09a7c431d2933bae0742c4f006239e2b7dc7fe834807a720d99f5fb65b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_880A9A00_6178_4781_9CAE_6D9A9E746C5D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had never felt anything like this before, and as such, he struggled to keep these strange "
"emotions in check."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼がこのような気持ちに陥るのは、⟪k:1⟫人生で初めてのことです。⟪k:2⟫ですから、⟪k:3⟫感情の手綱を"
"握ることも、⟪k:4⟫ままならなかったのでしょう。"

#: scenario:scenario_20A1CE6F_59BF_4E47_835D_99D923F40EB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87687915f3d063fef476f60513a717d6b51040fb246a62b94e2d8374f8dc5c36
#. default-sha256: abb08fb5a2b6dc45079bbb90c6a03a108210616a78478f7852a19c4f91e01fd9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20A1CE6F_59BF_4E47_835D_99D923F40EB5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Whenever he saw an opportunity, Mell would speak to the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫メルは機会を見ては、⟪k:1⟫白い髪の娘に声をかけましたわ。"

#: scenario:scenario_09E6D0B3_1622_4C92_8AF7_B90D012C79C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2cf1478f9c73e653de793f56ce5356ec6ff98d459acb52ff7475a818dbb0733
#. default-sha256: 5c6524c1a65c611af4bfa693788c7e3d83c9b92625ca29dc1a30fca2715908e3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_09E6D0B3_1622_4C92_8AF7_B90D012C79C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And days he was unable to, he either spent in secluded silence or a distracted daze."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それが出来ない日には、⟪k:1⟫彼は塞ぎこんでしまったように黙っているか、⟪k:2⟫ぼんやりと上の空で"
"いるかのどちらかです。"

#: scenario:scenario_3C246038_1524_4A89_9D60_2B80428E516B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dee3196904125beff746ba7d8bea13d51d47b9b5df90ac3a161523364de6fe2e
#. default-sha256: b92ca9dd1329b0a8adce2fbb61acfec8b6b0ae6053c653e3ac71e61839be8d69
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3C246038_1524_4A89_9D60_2B80428E516B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Love is a curious thing.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It has the power to change those who experience it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫恋とは不思議なものですわ……。⟪k:1⟫人を変えてしまうほど、⟪k:2⟫影響力を持つのですから。"

#: scenario:scenario_2A9CAE48_B5C8_4E32_B208_816384729909
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 44ff27d47f9b065b7770d95d1db4cefd369d7c5348ee746999a1981a73f063ee
#. default-sha256: f1ea9031b83f91de67163936d392b61cc928a18c0f734c98226776da62a8ffb1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2A9CAE48_B5C8_4E32_B208_816384729909"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When he did manage to approach her, he tripped over his tongue.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Again and again he "
"talked to her, and again and again he stumbled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼の話し方は、⟪k:1⟫やはりぎこちないものでした。⟪k:2⟫話しかけては失敗し、⟪k:3⟫けれどまた話しか"
"けて……その繰り返しです。"

#: scenario:scenario_EA508B09_5827_459B_B5C9_F5AF66CFEEC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24f695b4926fe887c90854a50f5e1373d91cc56f3c904c38ef9f31a28b597dd9
#. default-sha256: 58947dfda4c482f78bcc53f95fac58a707f81ad5cac4ff49e8187fea0624eb43
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EA508B09_5827_459B_B5C9_F5AF66CFEEC3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine, if you were to take him to see a romance at the theatre in his present state, he "
"would cry just as much as little Nellie."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫きっと今なら、⟪k:1⟫恋愛を語る演劇でも見て、⟪k:2⟫彼も大粒の涙を流すのではないでしょうか？"

#: scenario:scenario_2AF0A793_6732_4EA1_B1BA_593CA607E647
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 730502f2baba840bb38d91b6c07e546e5ea310f38cd8fc931885004862400f86
#. default-sha256: 9ab72f209894f23a65bdd9e756da58179cd28f9e59bc4bacaf65e2c0f558df92
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2AF0A793_6732_4EA1_B1BA_593CA607E647"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We cry at tragedies because we draw parallels with our own lives.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At least, that is "
"what I think."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫悲劇が泣けるのは、⟪k:1⟫自分の人生を照らし合わせるからですわ。⟪k:2⟫少なくともわたくしはそう思"
"います。"

#: scenario:scenario_0D975C78_27AC_402B_BC20_D506FE836692
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba6c10e8280c6e0b87d3652144a79bee016bd6d7962638eabac0e9ee7b754099
#. default-sha256: 0f52dec40e838290ff7d4600b9968640032de5f368243bfcbfac083db80836da
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0D975C78_27AC_402B_BC20_D506FE836692"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Great tales of romance attain true gravity with the audience only when they are personally "
"familiar with love."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫恋を知ってこそ、⟪k:1⟫大恋愛の物語に重みが出てくるのです……。"

#: scenario:scenario_06EFB4F0_E9DB_4947_9E6D_EC9DD52A8803
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85a490abf98064d5e056a6aff7304952114b7e22e8e979804b20d977d6869a8b
#. default-sha256: c2d5a075e9682908a3ae7df9e2557b95ce89f57f55bfdac558be7d06ea9500b5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_06EFB4F0_E9DB_4947_9E6D_EC9DD52A8803"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In any event, the White-Haired Girl was, as a result of this, visibly perturbed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫さて……当の白い髪の娘はと言えば、⟪k:1⟫彼の様子に、⟪k:2⟫困惑を隠しきれないようでした。"

#: scenario:scenario_A40B3A53_2E10_4AE9_9906_5D3260514FE3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa9a395c7f63c65f2bdaadaa49f53a4061709b2ba8b6e6b760286ca8c0e4fcb4
#. default-sha256: b4fa099cf8ec567a12794e18bab17b20c3eb9e9d60e056a9195d8fa9ebc41e40
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A40B3A53_2E10_4AE9_9906_5D3260514FE3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was delighted that he was being so kind to her, but confusion overpowered every other "
"emotion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫白い髪の娘としても、⟪k:1⟫優しく話しかけられるのは嬉しいことだったと思います。⟪k:2⟫けれど喜び"
"以上に、⟪k:3⟫動揺があったのです。"

#: scenario:scenario_E92AD7F5_DDA7_4F31_A873_BB1B2D85E22E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5650013bc23ce0c7f6949c747507eaf3aa1b90a83e013f5351db501d35d0567a
#. default-sha256: f3ea2a3b9bd3095a0256a9d36dfa3f4b22430955705c9c823f50a641611f46cc
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E92AD7F5_DDA7_4F31_A873_BB1B2D85E22E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She appeared to be at a loss for what to do as he clumsily catapulted words and stares at "
"her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫メルの言葉や、⟪k:1⟫亜麻色の視線を受ける中、⟪k:2⟫彼女はどうしていいか分からないようでした。"

#: scenario:scenario_11CAD9EE_62C5_4140_B892_8B13BF254B82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe1281951bdd50fd653046d860a0f2575d0cd660c325340da5ddfe4b767d2563
#. default-sha256: b8590949307b80a823e3ed5260d7b04d3f131adf2c3b08fadcb6fe90350ab206
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_11CAD9EE_62C5_4140_B892_8B13BF254B82"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But Mell did not back down—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫though he probably knew not what ⟪k:3⟫caused⟪k:4⟫ such "
"fiery emotion to erupt from within his breast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それでもメルはめげませんでした。⟪k:1⟫彼自身、⟪k:2⟫どうしてそこまで胸の奥が燃え上がり、⟪k:3⟫感"
"情がほとばしるのか分からなかったでしょう。"

#: scenario:scenario_18088729_EA9E_41E2_8B08_FD30C887B732
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57e3861a686fd513f4e405f77041b2819b0f774358247d1b69f30d9a0bff8309
#. default-sha256: 6839589f05e2688841653c3ebbf7caa1eb4f9e1a829b0e6e0f408daf9bb0ef99
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_18088729_EA9E_41E2_8B08_FD30C887B732"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One’s first love, in particular, tends to burn like a wildfire.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you familiar "
"with the sensation, Master?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫最初の恋というものは、⟪k:1⟫ことさら、⟪k:2⟫烈火のごとく燃え上がるものです。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫旦那さま"
"もお分かりになるのではありませんか？"

#: scenario:scenario_D35FE190_0FD7_4935_AF30_325B9163FF7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46f0e17868dff68be61fffc5f4613cbe484ad906a8ebdda58fc9bdfe380c78a4
#. default-sha256: 0e185b5a19428a245e7e1b005c0e3dbecc9d62247a2ce03a298ed96fd7e6f194
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D35FE190_0FD7_4935_AF30_325B9163FF7B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh? ⟪k:1⟫Hehehe."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫まあ……、⟪k:1⟫うふふ。"

#: scenario:scenario_A10B5545_1CA3_48D3_92E1_291FDC46E57E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d817337e7eca291e147f3cc99d27344cb01b7f932e6a16deb5f0f65aeb4c85ec
#. default-sha256: 3d3629739b0098e74b059ae49b76b524835a6cb7104f529102e928e66ef2f0b4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A10B5545_1CA3_48D3_92E1_291FDC46E57E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ah..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫あ……。"

#: scenario:scenario_0064EE85_B55F_4F23_BFFE_56AA12E5CDD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ac070d0757a006add2a459977ebc70d33e0084fda1d6f0be8a4e2dd2a68cbc3
