msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The letter contained numerous questions for the girl.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It also said that if she "
"attached her reply to the dove, it would bring the letter back to him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫手紙には女の子についての質問が並んでいました。⟪k:1⟫それから返事を鳩に括りつけてくれたら、"
"⟪k:2⟫手紙のやりとりが出来るということも。"

#: scenario:scenario_88A1B4A4_544C_4C3D_9D98_E4A5630AB3FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 151eac5e6701a3a660b91bf5589a74bef56263b4b7ba8ac477e551dc92410049
