msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The sealed door had been opened, and in the doorway stood a handsome "
"young man. ⟪k:5⟫“I have come for you,” he said."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫開かないはずだったお屋敷の扉が開き、⟪k:5⟫そこには綺麗な男性が立っていまし"
"た。⟪k:6⟫彼は言いました。⟪k:7⟫迎えにきたよ、⟪k:8⟫と。"

#: scenario:scenario_587D24C8_0F1A_4CA3_BEEE_FA016552CD02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a9de34abb7e34a1acb008357d097a7bc73fb21ae241fdcf63e6bcf919a3b6eb
#. default-sha256: 74b7defdd1dd59691398d8c4f162e3956c09be60ade67512fb7b2faeb1a6ba68
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_587D24C8_0F1A_4CA3_BEEE_FA016552CD02"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man was a prince from a neighboring kingdom. ⟪k:1⟫When the girl stepped outside, before "
"her sat a magnificent carriage—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the likes of which she had never before seen—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"accompanied by many servants."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫その男性は、⟪k:1⟫隣国の王子様だったのです。⟪k:2⟫女の子が外に出ると、⟪k:3⟫今まで見たこともない"
"豪華な馬車やたくさんの従者がいました。"

#: scenario:scenario_85008DAE_7D90_4D84_B7E9_08E84D3F21A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5935c9883400108371a1ca2df3b74336d8607dc7ee0e1f30ff7af6f6d4f4908b
#. default-sha256: 1030f9c01a52530b5d8820752cd1d62b4643cfa95bed1f5646170cd19207a842
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_85008DAE_7D90_4D84_B7E9_08E84D3F21A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The prince, kind as in the letters, swore his love to her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫王子様は女の子に変わらず優しく、⟪k:1⟫愛を誓います。"

#: scenario:scenario_EA4B82A1_1752_42A7_9AF9_2C915D3DBD06
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57428c6ff73784fbc89a929f9e9a6f513c2f87d10f93580facdd933ffba2c6d0
